        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text: In Shopify admin open **Store Tasks** from Apps. Typical links are [Tasks](/tasks) for work, [Support](/support) for conversations, plus [FAQ](/faq), [Documentation](/docs), [Tutorial](/tutorial), [Changelog](/changelog), [Billing](/billing), and [Privacy](/privacy). Shops and ticketing tools may expose [Shops](/ShopifyShops) and [Tickets](/ShopifySupportTickets) depending on setup.
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
